<title>SWEDEN: Trygg-Hansa posts final 1996 figures.</title>
<headline>Trygg-Hansa posts final 1996 figures.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish insurer Trygg-Hansa on Thursday released final figures for 1996 which were a slight change from preliminary figures released on February 6.</p>
<p>The insurer posted a group pre-tax profit of 2.43 billion crowns against 1.85 billion crowns a year ago.</p>
<p>The result for the non-life insurance operations was 755 million crowns against 577 million a year earlier.</p>
<p>Following are the final figures for 1996.</p>
<p>					  (million crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit			   2,431  vs  1,847</p>
<p>  - non life insurance		    755  vs    577</p>
<p>  - others operations		   1,676  vs  1,270</p>
<p> Gross premiums written		12,160  vs 11,779</p>
<p>  - non-life insurance		  5,902  vs  6,465</p>
<p>  - life insurance (unitlinked)	 974  vs    649</p>
<p>  - commissioned Trygg-Hansa Life   5,284  vs  4,665</p>
<p> Net profit				 2,367  vs  1,576</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
